            <h2>Your learning goals</h2>
              <p>By working through this session, you will cover the following criteria of your Level 2 Certificate in the Principles of Cyber Security.</p>
<ol>
<li>Common cyber crime vulnerabilities of an individual, business or nation</li>
<li>Impact of cyber crime on an individual, business or nation.</li>
<li>The importance of cyber security for an individual, business or nation.</li>
<li>Why cyber security issues should be reported promptly</li>
</ol>

          
