        <section id="common-cyber-crime-vulnerabilities."  class="t-bg-primary1a">
          
            <h2>Common Cyber Crime Vulnerabilities.</h2>
              <p>'Cybercrime is now a trillion-dollar cost to the global economy' as reported by cybersecurity firm McAfee.
Cyber criminals seek to exploit vulnerabilities in technology, people, or processes in order to commit their crimes. These may be used to steal data, passwords or money directly. The most common cyber threats include Hacking, Phishing, Malware and Ransomware and DD0S attacks.</p>
<p>Select the images below to read about those at risk.</p>

              
